n.","image_url":"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/v1572282926/swr/twitter-card.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"swr.vercel.app","service_icon":"https://swr.vercel.app/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://swr.vercel.app/ja/docs/conditional-fetching#%E4%BE%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%80%A7","original_url":"https://swr.vercel.app/ja/docs/conditional-fetching#%E4%BE%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%80%A7"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"prc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d414aad-ef36-4c76-b557-43a9dbeb2141","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"codegenってapolloのhooksまで生成しちゃうんですよね・・・\nクライアントだけ生成ってできるんだろうか","ts":"1633837908.308800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N82mG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5edd3c0-24a9-4b1f-bdc9-d4d9d3a0b4a5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"引数にundefined取るにはlazy使うしかないんですよね","ts":"1633837858.307900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WwT0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8DFB7BC4-ECAA-4616-964E-99325C72D050","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"API clientだけ apollo で作って、hooks は SWR 経由にするとかで解決はできそう","ts":"1633837852.307700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DugJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122d7079-44ce-446b-8cef-d8c694db4d46","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それ羨ましい","ts":"1633837843.307100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RYeb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C48B0E5C-6CEE-4860-AA9D-5B640731A766","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"loading 中の data は undefined が返ってきますね。で、クエリ引数に undefined 与えても undefined が返るだけになっています。","ts":"1633837828.306800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wHI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8332b00-f6cd-46c4-8b48-4d164794df43","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"SWR、loading中nullになることないんです？\nそれとも受ける側がnullableを許容してて、値が入ったタイミングでfetchしにいくとか？","ts":"1633837730.304700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5NnFc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"851D5287-39FE-4C66-9755-840771B8CFFF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"SWRだと発生しない問題ですね。hooks の前に if 書くのは宜しくないですしね。","ts":"1633837686.303300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6rD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b034739c-4bf7-4232-a230-345f05e43342","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"この問題が解決したら綺麗に書けるんですけど、apolloレベルでどうにかしてくれないかなーって","ts":"1633835667.302000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b9e7320-bee0-42e6-a373-73289314f334","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"useBarする前にifで分岐できれば問題ないんですけど、hooksだからそれもできないしで綺麗に書く方法が思いつかず","ts":"1633834564.301300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QYaP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5abb8323-281b-4253-ae71-612879eed966","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```const [getBar, { data: data2, loading }] = useBarLazyQuery()\n\nif (data1 != null) {\n  getBar({ variables: { foo: data1.value } })\n}```\nなら通るんですけど、正直この書き方をしたくないからどうしようかなって感じで（本当はifはuseEffectの中で使わないといけないけど省略してます）","ts":"1633834461.300300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633834637.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xfc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"771fdac5-f17b-43a5-a09e-dbf9dc80514c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"具体的に言うと\n```const { data: data1, loading } = useFooQuery() // loadされるまでdata1はnullable\nconst { data: data2, loading } = useBarQuery({ variables: { foo: data1?.value } })```\nが型エラー吐くんですよ","ts":"1633834347.298300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633834601.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zq3R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a3090c6-b99e-4b16-84eb-c1c376329ccb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"fetchのときに受けるvariableの型がGraphQLのクエリレベルで静的に決まる上に返り値の型はnullableなので、custom hookで複数のfetchを組み合わせて作りたいときにLazyを使わないとうまく書けない問題が発生していて","ts":"1633834224.296500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m/F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c676a73-37f2-435d-88ad-9366b460d021","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"hooksの定義で結構困ってるんですよね\n具体的にはuseFooQueryとuseFooLazyQueryが生えて\n\n多分意図的にはLazyQueryってユーザのインタラクションを受けてonClickとかに対してfetchを走らせるものだと思うんですが","ts":"1633834080.294800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M4Aj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EDF08440-7B61-4046-9EA5-CFA7DD972D01","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕は今度使うかもってステータスですね。知り合いは使ってました","ts":"1633833725.293000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NnL9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"139bce8d-f4d1-44b3-b103-b42454159c85","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"GraphQL CodeGenでapolloのhooks自動生成使ってる人っていますか？","ts":"1633831662.292100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Lyi"}]}]
